sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant UI as Web (Next.js)
  participant CX as Convex mutation
  participant DB as Convex DB
  participant SC as Scheduler
  participant AC as sendStatusChange (Node action)
  participant N8 as n8n webhook
  participant EV as Evolution API
  participant WA as WhatsApp

  S->>UI: click "Submit"
  UI->>CX: applications.student.createApplication(args)
  CX->>DB: insert applications row (status=under_review)
  CX->>DB: insert notifications (fan-out to supervisors)
  CX->>DB: insert whatsappOutbox (status=queued)
  CX->>SC: ctx.scheduler.runAfter(0, sendStatusChange)
  CX-->>UI: ack {appId}
  UI-->>S: toast "تم إرسال الطلب"

  Note over SC,AC: action runs after the mutation commits

  SC->>AC: invoke sendStatusChange({outboxId})
  AC->>DB: _getOutbox(outboxId)
  AC->>AC: body = JSON.stringify(payload)<br/>signature = HMAC-SHA256(body, N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET)
  AC->>N8: POST /webhook/wa-status<br/>X-Signature: signature
  N8->>N8: verify HMAC<br/>build text per status
  N8->>EV: POST /message/sendText/zuj<br/>apikey, number, text
  EV-->>N8: 200 OK
  N8-->>AC: 200 "Workflow was started"
  AC->>DB: _patchOutbox(status=sent)
  EV->>WA: deliver message
  WA-->>S: rendered in chat
